<title>USA: Powell, Van Kampen CEO, elected ICI chairman.</title>
<headline>Powell, Van Kampen CEO, elected ICI chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Investment Company Institute said Don Powell, chief executive officer of Van Kampen American Capital Inc, was elected chairman of the mutual fund trade group.</p>
<p>Powell was elected to a one-year term at the ICI's board meeting on Friday.</p>
<p>Powell replaced Jon Fossel, the chairman of Oppenheimer Funds.</p>
